  "notes": "The Claude conversation view: chat-title header (sidebar toggle + title; solid bg band that clips the scrolled text at css y 86.7), one assistant message in the serif (pre-wrapped plain text: section headings are just ALL-CAPS lines ending in ':' after a blank line — same size and weight as the body), the Claude spark under the message, and the docked composer ('Write a message...', +, model label, chevron, mic, voice) with the disclaimer line. Placeholders: {{content_html}} (the message text, already escaped/marked up by the template), {{title}} (chat title; empty = none), {{placeholder}}, {{model_label}} (kit.model_label), {{disclaimer}}. The template scrolls the element at scroll_sel (translateY) and draws marker highlights inside text_sel. Lead: merge as kit.message and add \"Gelasio\": \"Gelasio.ttf\" to kit.fonts. Reference values: message font 18.89 px / line pitch 29.0 px at the start view (screen px) = 16.21 / 24.89 css; text column 795.6 screen px (682.9 css; set so every reference line wraps where the reference wraps) starting at screen x 560; composer 847x121.5 screen px at (536.5, 914.5).",
